a manhunt is under way for the gunman  who opened fire at an off-campus College  party in Texas the shooting early  yesterday killed two people and hurt 12  others and a vigil last night for one of  the victims was interrupted by more  gunfire dramatic cell phone video video  captured the chaos inside the party  Mireya Villarreal is in Greenville Texas  near the scene of the first shooting  Maria have any suspects been identified  at this point we know Anthony right now  we do not know who is responsible for  either shooting but this is where the  first one happened and as the shooter  fired off his gun partygoers streamed  out of the building that you see right  behind me  hundreds of them running for their lives  with just two exits to choose from there  was another shooting in Texas last night  this time at a vigil as family and  friends gathered in Dallas to remember  23 year old Kevin berry jr. one of the  alleged victims of a homecoming party  shooting early Sunday morning Berry was  allegedly one of two people killed at an  off-campus party in Greenville Texas  near the Texas A&amp;M university-commerce  campus horrific cell phone video  captured the shooting as it was  happening 12 other people were injured  six of them have gunshot wounds  [Applause]  investigators believe this shooter came  into the building through a back door  and may have targeted someone at the  party but deputies say they are not sure  because some witnesses are not  cooperating I don't know if they're  afraid if they're afraid of being  retaliated against we really need people  to come forward  more than 750 people were at the party  at the time of the shooting  investigators say the gunman was able to  get away by blending in with the large  crowd during the panic and the chaos the  suspects our suspects were able to flee  the scene and we were working on  identifying them at this point Ciera  VTOL was at the homecoming party and  says she has a personal connection to  some of the victims it's kind of sad  knowing that we were here like coming to  like celebrate something and then like  something like this happens but I mean I  guess this is just the world that we  live in now  the local sheriff's department tells me  they are monitoring the shooting that  happened at the vigil in Dallas in the  meantime they have the FBI and the ATF  here in Greenville Texas helping with  this investigation Tony  Maria thank you very much
 

